stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Discovered: discover()
  Discovered --> Constructed: TTDevice(model)
  Constructed --> Initialized: init_tt_device()
  Constructed --> Failed: firmware timeout / version mismatch
  Initialized --> Operational: start_device()
  Operational --> Faulted: exception (hang, SIGBUS, timeout)
  Faulted --> Constructed: warm reset + re-open
  Operational --> Closed: close_device() / destructor
  Failed --> [*]
  Closed --> [*]
  Operational: Operational
  Operational: read / write, firmware commands, DMA
